<p>Welcome!</p>

<p>This blog is a collection of short to medium essays holistically advocating for <a href="/about/universal-agency/">universal agency</a> and fulfillment, written from the perspective of a <a href="https://thewishfulskeptic.substack.com/about" target="_blank">wishful skeptic</a>. As such, it promotes epistemic humility and caution, consistency, honesty, tolerance, leniency, and nurturing harmonious dissent and coexistence in the world and oneself.</p>

<p>If you'd like to peruse the blog's content, take a look at the <a href="/blog/">latest posts</a>.</p>

